===
title: "Use EBS snapshots instead of Barman backups?"
subTitle: First-principles pro/con map for CNPG base backups on EKS — filesystem-level EBS volume snapshots through the CSI snapshotter versus barman-cloud base backups streamed to S3, with WAL archiving to object storage required for point-in-time recovery under either design
author: Claude and 3uzbcqje
date: 2026-09-01
